<title>USA: N.Y. Fed Press Briefing - December 12.</title>
<headline>N.Y. Fed Press Briefing - December 12.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve said it had no net misses in its reserve projections in the latest week, a Fed spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The high in natural float was about $1.2 billion on Tuesday, while the low was a bit over $750 million on Thursday.</p>
<p>Transportation float averaged about $100 million per day, with the high on Friday at a bit under $150 million primarily due to fog in the Jacksonville, Fla. area.</p>
<p>-Al Yoon, 212-859-1672</p>
